 "descriptions": {
  "ducklake-postgres-no-inlining": "DuckLake, default settings: metadata in Postgres, one single-row INSERT per commit. DuckLake keeps a row this small inline in the catalog, so no Parquet file is written unless BENCH_DUCKLAKE_INLINE_ROWS=0 turns inlining off; the version line says when it was set. This entry sets BENCH_DUCKLAKE_INLINE_ROWS=0, so every commit writes a Parquet file."
 },
